---
description: Strict naming for HTTP request → use-case mappers (body / query / params)
globs: "**/presentation/**/request-mappers/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# HTTP request mappers — naming (strict)

Папки presentation:

- request → `presentation/http/request-mappers/` (не `mappers/`)
- response → `presentation/http/http-responses/` (не `response/`)

В `presentation/http/request-mappers/` **запрещён** префикс `payload-to-*` / `payloadTo*`.

Мапперы в use-case **всегда** заканчиваются на `use-case-input` / `UseCaseInput` (не просто `input` / `Input`).

| Источник | Файл | Функция |
|----------|------|---------|
| `@HttpBody` | `request-body-to-<action>-use-case-input.ts` | `requestBodyTo<Action>UseCaseInput` |
| `@HttpQuery` (GET list/by-id/search) | `request-query-params-to-<action>-use-case-input.ts` | `requestQueryParamsTo<Action>UseCaseInput` |
| Только `@HttpParams` / session (delete, complete, mark-read, …) | `request-params-to-<action>-use-case-input.ts` | `requestParamsTo<Action>UseCaseInput` |

## Query specifics

- List → `FindManyParams`: `request-query-params-to-find-many-params.mapper.ts` / `requestQueryParamsToFindManyParams` (не use-case-input — это не `I*ApplicationInput`)
- GET by id: `request-query-params-to-get-<entity>-by-id-use-case-input.ts` / `requestQueryParamsToGet<Entity>ByIdUseCaseInput`
- Другой GET из query: `request-query-params-to-get-<…>-use-case-input.ts`, `…-to-search-…-use-case-input`, `…-to-find-…`, `…-to-query-…`

## Compose после list-mapper

Если mapper принимает уже готовый `FindManyParams` (+ actor), а не raw query:

- Файл: `find-many-params-to-get-<…>-use-case-input.ts`
- Функция: `findManyParamsToGet<…>UseCaseInput`

## Примеры

```ts
// body
request-body-to-create-favorite-master-service-use-case-input.ts
requestBodyToCreateFavoriteMasterServiceUseCaseInput

// query GET by id
request-query-params-to-get-appointment-chat-by-id-use-case-input.ts
requestQueryParamsToGetAppointmentChatByIdUseCaseInput

// path params only
request-params-to-delete-appointment-chat-use-case-input.ts
requestParamsToDeleteAppointmentChatUseCaseInput
```

## Не путать

- Zod/AJV типы payload (`I*Payload`, `*-payload.schema.ts`) — без переименования.
- Application DTO: `I*ApplicationInput` — без суффикса UseCase в типе.
- Response: `http-responses/map-*-response.ts`.
- Orchestration: `output-*-to-*-use-case-input.ts` / `output*To*UseCaseInput`.
